This package bundles AdGuard URL Tracking filter data (filter 17) from:

https://github.com/AdguardTeam/AdguardFilters
(fetched through https://github.com/AdguardTeam/FiltersRegistry)

The filter file's header names its license as AdGuard Filters' license,
GPL-3.0. The bundled data is reproduced under GPL-3.0-only; see
LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt. The adapter code is MIT.

This source is not part of @url-sanitize/merged's default catalog. Pass
adguardCatalog to mergeSources() to opt in.
